{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2021-12-02 15:19:00', 'title': 'NANORACKS, VOYAGER SPACE, AND LOCKHEED MARTIN AWARDED NASA CONTRACT TO BUILD FIRST-OF-ITS-KIND COMMERCIAL SPACE STATION', 'text': "DENVER, DEC. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NANORACKS, IN COLLABORATION WITH VOYAGER SPACE AND LOCKHEED MARTIN [NYSE: LMT], HAS BEEN AWARDED A $160 MILLION CONTRACT BY NASA TO DESIGN ITS STARLAB COMMERCIAL SPACE STATION AS PART OF THE AGENCY'S COMMERCIAL LOW-EARTH ORBIT (LEO) DEVELOPMENT PROGRAM. STARLAB WILL ENABLE NASA'S INITIATIVE TO STIMULATE THE COMMERCIAL SPACE ECONOMY AND PROVIDE SCIENCE AND CREW CAPABILITIES PRIOR TO THE RETIREMENT OF THE INTERNATIONAL SPACE STATION (ISS)."}